findings.what:
Minor divergences on unrealistic inputs were left alone:
- pack_hour(True) packs hour 1 where Python returns False;
- a bool or str fs is converted differently;
- a FLAC with 3 or more channels and 0 frames;
- hours beyond int64 / HOUR_MAX;
- non-ASCII digits in hour names.

